# Network Health Check Automation

Automated tool that checks DNS resolution, HTTP status and TLS certificate expiry for multiple endpoints.

## Features
- DNS check using socket
- HTTP status check (200 OK)
- TLS expiry check (warns if <30 days)
- Logs results to console/file

## Tech Stack
Python, Shell, Linux, TCP/IP, HTTP, DNS, TLS/SSL, Git

## How to Run
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python health_check.py
